      "writtenOn": "2022-09-08T13:46:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "And, looking back, I think I totally misunderstood your question.\n\nAnyway, I have changed onDied to onStopped, which I think is better and certainly gives us consistency.",
      "parentUuid": "bac2e822_a77a2dc5",
      "range": {
